   "text": "<<THE FURY OF THE FUTURE>>  \n\nIN THE YEAR 2147, THE WORLD WAS NO LONGER WHAT IT USED TO BE. THE EARTH HAD BEEN SHATTERED BY A CIVIL WAR BETWEEN TWO GREAT NATIONS, THE EARTH UNION AND THE EARTH REBELLION. THE REBELLION WAS A FURY OF HUMANITY, A BLOODBATH OF TECHNOLOGY AND TRUST. THE EARTH UNION, WITH ITS FORTRESS OF SCIENCE AND ORDER, FIGHTED BACK WITH A FURY OF INNOVATION AND DETERRENCE.  \n\nTHE FURY OF THE FUTURE WAS NOT JUST A WAR. IT WAS A TEST. A TEST OF HUMANITY, OF FEAR, OF DETERRENCE, AND OF THE VERY CORE OF WHAT IT MEANT TO BE A HUMAN.  \n\nIN THE BEGINNING, THERE WAS ONLY A FIGHT. THEN, A WAR. THEN, A FURY. AND THEN, A FUTURE THAT WOULD NEVER BE.  \n\nTHE EARTH UNION WOULD NOT BE BOWED. IT WOULD NOT BE BLOWN. IT WOULD BE REBORN.  \n\nAND THE FURY OF THE FUTURE WOULD NEVER BE FALTERED.",
